From 7e1ff0487e1bef6d118706aa63720221423740ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:29:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] www: language packs for v3.7.3, 25 dictionaries

New text in all 25 packs: the Security Review's /tmp and /var folders (RFW_410, RDSH_119) and the
Wallguard Advanced rules (RSHD_178..182).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
